    \ replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained\
    \ drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `reflect` (in Research Counter); YAML not provided/parsed. Guidance: 1. Place YAML immediately on next line after action. 2. Start with ```yaml and end with ``` on a new line without indentation. 3. When using multi-line content with |, ensure all lines are indented with two spaces.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Action 'reflect' not recognized in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do\
    \ not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 552 | 1 | Aether II: VLC-Probe v1 (Training Probes, v10) - Full PPO & Conditional Logging | Aether II | 320 | n.a. |\n| 541 | 1 | Aether II: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, v9) - Kurtosis Attribute Fix | Aether II | 314 | n.a. |\n| 535 | 1 | Aether II: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, v8) - Spectral Norm Fix | Aether II | 310 | n.a. |\n| 530 | 1 | Aether II: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, v7) - SOTA Arch Debug | Aether II | 309 | n.a. |\n| 503 | 1 | Aether I: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, v6) - SOTA Arch (96f, Dilation=7, vlc=0.45) - Rerun Debug... | Aether I | 291 | n.a. |\n| 501 | 1 | Aether I: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, v5) - SOTA Arch (96f, Dilation=7, vlc=0.45) - Rerun Debug... | Aether I | 289 | n.a. |\n| 498 | 1 | Aether I: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, v4) - SOTA\
    \ Arch (96f, Dilation=7, vlc=0.45) - Rerun Debug... | Aether I | 288 | n.a. |\n| 493 | 1 | Aether I: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization) - SOTA Arch (96f, Dilation=7, vlc=0.45) - Rerun Debugged ... | Aether I | 285 | n.a. |\n| 492 | 1 | Aether I: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization) - SOTA Arch (96f, Dilation=7, vlc=0.45) - Rerun Debugged ... | Aether I | 284 | n.a. |\n| 489 | 1 | Aether I: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization) - SOTA Arch (96f, Dilation=7, vlc=0.45) - Rerun Debugged | Aether I | 283 | n.a. |\n\nPage 1 of 9 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-9, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty\
