- text: 'I am in the Reflection Chamber and have identified the source of the `TypeError` in Evaluation 572. The `phase_name` argument (a string) passed to the JIT-compiled `_generate_probe_metrics_jitted` function was not marked as static, causing JAX to attempt to trace it as an array.


    To resolve this, I need to add `phase_name` to the `static_argnames` for `_generate_probe_metrics_jitted`. This will ensure the JIT compilation correctly handles the string argument.


    I will now proceed to the Research Counter to submit this fix.


