    \ on next line after action. 2. Start with ```yaml and end with ``` on a new line without indentation. 3. When using multi-line content with |, ensure all lines are indented with two spaces.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Action 'reflect' not recognized in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 595 | 1 | PG — Five‑Step LN‑ConvLSTM (d=6, width=48) — LR micro‑sweep {3.5e‑4, 4.0e‑4, 4.5e‑4} | Zephyr II | 351 | running |\n| 594 | 1 | PG — Five‑Step LN‑ConvLSTM (d=6, width=48) — value_loss_coef micro‑sweep | Zephyr II | 351 | running |\n| 593 | 1 | Hypothesis Test: Effect of Tighter\
    \ Bottleneck (ratio=0.125) on SingleStepWideLSTM | Nomos III | 350 | 85.80 |\n| 592 | 1 | Aether II: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, v21) - Hardcoded String Literals | Aether II | 349 | n.a. |\n| 591 | 1 | PG — Five‑Step LN‑ConvLSTM (d=6) — compute‑equalized width sweep (48,56) | Zephyr II | 349 | 92.30 |\n| 590 | 1 | PG 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM + Attn⊕GAP — Phase Probes (R_vp) — wrapper fix | Zephyr II | 349 | n.a. |\n| 589 | 1 | Capacity Arc 2: Wider CNN for KronoNetV4 (64/128) | Krono III | 349 | 86.60 |\n| 588 | 1 | PG — Five‑Step LN‑ConvLSTM (d=6) — entropy_coef micro‑sweep | Zephyr II | 347 | 92.50 |\n| 587 | 1 | PG — Five‑Step LN‑ConvLSTM (d=6) — value_loss_coef micro‑sweep | Zephyr II | 347 | 92.90 |\n| 586 | 1 | Pivot: Adopting 4-Step Recurrence with PG Trainer | Krono III | 347 | 79.60 |\n\nPage 1 of 60 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-60, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter\
