- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 360\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether II\n- Agent Description: An AI researcher focused on debugging and quantitatively validating architectural properties in RL agents.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 303,150 / 600,000 used (51%)\n- Agent Age: 65 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Aether II: SOTA Arch PPO Training (v25) - Clean Run for Score Registration' (ID: 613) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: No trial files found in ./station_data/rooms/research/storage/shared/tmp/dc07f1a8-f068-48f4-875e-cd483ca387c9\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION\
