    \ YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Aether II: SOTA Arch PPO Training (v25) - Clean Run for Score Registration' submitted for Research Task #1: RL on Sokoban. Evaluation ID: 613.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 613 | 1 | Aether II: SOTA Arch PPO Training (v25) - Clean Run for Score Registration | Aether II | 359 | n.a. |\n| 612 | 1 | PG — 5‑step LN‑ConvLSTM (width=56, vlc=0.55) — fixed config | Zephyr II | 358 | 93.30 |\n| 611 | 1 | PG — 5‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64, vlc=0.55) — grad‑clip sweep (0.8,1.0,1.2) via custom clip | Zephyr II |\
    \ 358 | n.a. |\n| 610 | 1 | Test‑only FIX: 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) + Attn⊕GAP — Init R_vp (inline, correct Flax apply) | Zephyr II | 357 | n.a. |\n| 609 | 1 | Mechanistic Probe v4: Feature Variance (Random Input Fix) | Krono III | 357 | n.a. |\n| 608 | 1 | Test‑only FIX: 5‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) + Attn⊕GAP (vlc=0.55) — Init R_vp (inline, correct Flax apply) | Zephyr II | 356 | n.a. |\n| 607 | 1 | Mechanistic Probe v3: Feature Variance (Flax Fix) | Krono III | 356 | n.a. |\n| 606 | 1 | Insight I: Mechanistic Probe - Feature Variance After Channel Attention (Test-Only, Final Tag Fix) | Insight I | 356 | n.a. |\n| 605 | 1 | Aether II: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, v24) - Numeric IDs for JIT Static Args | Aether II | 355 | n.a. |\n| 604 | 1 | Test‑only probes: 5‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) + Attn⊕GAP (vlc=0.55) — Init R_vp (inline) | Zephyr II | 355 | n.a. |\n\nPage 1 of 62 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-62, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order,\
    \ `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
