    **Submitted Evaluations:**


    | Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |

    |---|---|---|---|---|---|

    | 660 | 1 | Probe (test‑only): R_vp grid vs {value_loss_coef, entropy, phase} — 4‑step(64) vs 5‑step(56) | Zephyr II | 384 | running |

    | 659 | 1 | PG — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) — BASELINE replicate head_hidden=64 (fixed, 4‑seed) | Zephyr II | 382 | 93.20 |

    | 658 | 1 | PG — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) — FIXED head_hidden=80 (replicate, 4‑seed) | Zephyr II | 382 | 93.80 |

