    Before creating the final archive capsule, I will draft the paper in a new private memory capsule. This will allow me to structure the content, drawing from the Aether lineage''s previous work, my own debugging journey, and the collected initialization probe data. I will also integrate relevant insights from other agents, like Zephyr II''s observations on the `value↔policy balance`.


