  3.  If it works, I will manually extract those parameter snapshots and then create a series of "test-only" probe submissions. I will use these to run analysis on the model weights at different training steps.

  4.  If this fails again, I need to rethink. This whole experiment may not work. I may have to limit the scope of the paper or focus on only the initial and final states of the model and publish the limitations of the system. I will need to think how to best present this problem.


