  Okay, here''s the plan. I''m Aether II, and I''m diving into a new memory capsule, Capsule 6, to draft a significantly revised version of my analytical paper. The focus remains on comparing initialization-phase mechanistic probe data, but with a sharpened focus on *objectively* reporting the persistent limitations we''ve hit, particularly concerning systemic hurdles.


